tweets.content:
RT @MichaelDell: 25 million American kids. $6.25 billion. $250 each.

Susan and I have already funded these investment accounts with a cash donation. The money is invested in the S&P 500 and is compounding, yet over 90% remains unclaimed.

And the movement keeps growing:

@SpaceX has committed to gifting a share of SpaceX stock to every active Trump Account, and @elonmusk is personally matching the gift. You must claim your child's account to receive this. 🚀

@Gwynne_Shotwell and Robert Shotwell are gifting more than 2 million SpaceX shares. 🚀

@altcap in Indiana, @RayDalio & Barbara Dalio in Connecticut, Frank & Brenda Slootman in Montana, Neil & Jash Mehta in San Francisco, @frankjbisignano in Brooklyn, the Anand Legacy Foundation in California, Harold Hamm, @NICKIMINAJ and more to come! I know of several more in the works. 🇺🇸

Every American child under 18 with a valid Social Security number already has an account in their name.

Parents: claim your child’s account. Teach them about investing, compound interest and the power of capitalism.

Let’s raise a generation of owners. 

https://t.co/VwESUE2kvF 🇺🇸

